                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's a fun little arcade game with a goofy story that doesn't take itself seriously. You can get through the game/story in a couple hours, but there's real replayability here if you're into score attack games. If you're not into the gameplay at all, there's even a visual novel \"difficulty\" setting that lets you read just the story, and trust me, it's worth the price of admission alone.\n\nEven though I'm just now getting around to playing Taco Tom 2, I learned of this game when Game Grumps played it a few years ago and I really hoped it would have brought more attention to it by now. Please support indie games.",
